    "secondary pairs": "each control arm vs C0: these also contain the interruption, the discarded queue, another inference schedule, the spent budget and other noise draws",
    "delta_mean_outcome": "mean(y_arm - y_reference) over blocks",
    "NA": "the denominator is zero; this is not 0%"
